### Parking Management System API Test Requests

### 1. Root API Info
GET http://localhost:8000/

### 2. Get All Users
GET http://localhost:8000/api/users

### 3. Search Users (Search by name or email)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/users?search=Alice

### 4. Get User by ID
GET http://localhost:8000/api/users/1

### 5. Create New User
POST http://localhost:8000/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "David Miller",
  "email": "david@example.com",
  "role": "user"
}

### 6. Create User Validation Error (Duplicate Email Test)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Duplicate Test",
  "email": "alice@example.com"
}

### 7. Update User
PUT http://localhost:8000/api/users/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Robert Smith",
  "email": "bob.smith@example.com",
  "role": "admin"
}

### 8. Delete User
DELETE http://localhost:8000/api/users/3
